// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// LATE-PATCH v23 — MIAS FULL MODERNIZATION
//
// Fixes (in order):
//  1. Play command   — reactions only (🌀/✅/❌), no progress text; artwork
//                      embedded as jpegThumbnail Buffer for ALL recipients
//  2. GST command    — caption bug fixed (strip cmd name from args);
